        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why is she here...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Demetri"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_690_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's T-Texas!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've already lost a lot of our men!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bodyguard"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_690_1#9$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_698_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch, we shouldn't have let Lavinia talk to that piece of trash for so long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Demetri"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forget it. After seeing her colleague fall to utter depravity, that woman's spirit is done for.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Demetri"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as we can snuff out Leon's childishness, it doesn't matter how we do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Demetri"
    },
    {
        "text": "Call our people back. We're leaving.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Demetri"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
