    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_697_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "They... They turned around and left!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Court Clerk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He's already dead. Took an arrow straight through the heart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you. If not for you all, I'd have been the one to die here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Close your eyes, murderer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "ypos": -30,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "ypos": 30,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$book_close"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's this...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A notebook?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "A Siracusan judge license. He was keeping it in his breast pocket.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_paper2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Its corner has been clipped, and it's written here that the holder was disbarred three years ago for malfeasance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#14$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Malfeasance, huh. Malfeasance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#15$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could they really not come up with a better excuse?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... think I should be asking you how you got out of prison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Trade secret.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fair enough. I don't have the energy to pursue that either right now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need to rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't do that just yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "This trail has gone cold. I need another lead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yan has a saying: 'haste makes waste.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course I know that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But time is a luxury I can't afford anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Was Carracci important to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only ever met him a few times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "After all, I am a judge, and our roles could hardly be further apart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But as any resident of Volsinii can tell you, he was an extremely vigorous man, smoothly navigating his relationships with the famiglie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "He dedicated all his time and energy to the construction of the new city area, trying everything at his disposal to give the people a safer place to live.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "By investigating his death, I've come to better understand his life.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Carefully, delicately, as if walking on thin ice, he would desperate rack his brain to produce anything of value that could be exchanged for a little more breathing room to carry out his work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "For example, building more schools and hospitals far away from the turf fought over by the famiglie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not sure how I should think of him. Maybe he was just a decent man, with the slightest bit of a conscience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But the fates of decent people in Siracusa are already sealed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like this man... a hitman carrying a judge license.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Siracusa has proper law schools.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "They use textbooks published in Columbia. After graduating, students aren't restricted to working in local Siracusan law firms and institutions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "They also gain accreditation in Columbia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nowadays, our exchanges with Lungmen are becoming more and more frequent. Maybe with enough time, even Great Yan will come to recognize our certifications.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is. Of course it's good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But none of that makes any difference.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "My alma mater once invited me back to deliver a speech to my juniors, to give them some confidence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I went.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I got up on that stage, I wanted to tell them to believe in what they had learned. But I just couldn't do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "In Siracusa, the law works because of the existence of a single person, not because it's based on any sort of universally-recognized fairness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "In a sense, it's even more absurd than complete lawlessness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "More incredibly, after almost sixty years, the Siracusans have gotten so used to living in this environment that nobody dares to question it now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#14$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Am I justice personified? No. I might be a symbol, but even I do not know what stands behind my back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1028_texas2_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Want to grab a bite?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_4065_judge_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...That'd be nice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grazie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lavinia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
